 Area while Kikunojo is gone.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qgY7ZURswRiyv7AxUDvXHcUskGT.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10181","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20457","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"20787","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60834","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"276890","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"1853","synopsis":"Seitenshi's vehicle is hit by a sniper while she in enroute to her meeting. Rentaro realizes this is more than a mere assassination attempt and gets help from Miori to find out more about the attack.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fVZfTk7XlezC2VaVvAuVvBzEHzf.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Seitenshi's vehicle is hit by a sniper while she in enroute to her meeting. Rentaro realizes this is more than a mere assassination attempt and gets help from Miori to find out more about the attack.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fVZfTk7XlezC2VaVvAuVvBzEHzf.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10181","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20457","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"20787","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60834","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"276890","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"1854","synopsis":"Rentaro gets hurt trying to protect Seitenshi from the sniper. The security plan that Seitenshi's bodyguards had set up were leaked to the sniper. Enju had gone after the sniper and falls into a co